        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Every service owns its datastore. No service reads another's database. All player state is keyed on characterId.&lt;br&gt;Content is what authors write; state is what a player's own character accumulates." style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#607d8b;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
