        <mxCell id="pe-sub" value="Who publishes what, and what is in it. A publisher owns its exchange and the schema of its events; nobody else declares them and nobody else changes them." style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#607d8b;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
